Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(dex): open the National Dex to #1025, Kalos to
 Paldea

Eggs hatch from every base species up to #1025 and evolution trees are no longer cut at #649. The base index is cached under a name tied to the cap, so an index cached by the official build is not reused. The egg pool was measured again (540 bases): a rare egg still beats repeated uncommon eggs.
